your practice because he had not felt good this
morning and vomited twice. Your diagnosis is
viral gastroenteritis, and you explain your
management plan to her and issue a medical
certificate for him for his school. Martha also
requests a medical certificate for herself
because she did not go to work today to bring
Daniel to you. Which of the following is the
