smokes 40 cigarettes a day, drinks alcohol
regularly, and drinks 4 cups of coffee daily. He
loves spicy foods and eats a lot of them. On
examination, his height is 178 cm, and weighs
110 kg. He has a waist circumference of 115
cm. Which one of the following is the most
appropriate advice for him regarding the long-
