after she fell off her bed. On examination,
she has a blood pressure of 100/75 mmHg, a
pulse rate of 90 bpm, a respiratory rate of 21
breaths per minute, and a temperature of
37.6°C. There is no tenderness, rebound, or
guarding on abdominal examination. Which
