heavy menstrual bleeding. She is known to
have multiple uterine fibroids. Other significant
point in history is dilation and curettage 6
months ago with no improvement in her
symptoms, or no diagnosis for a cause. On
examination, the uterus has the size of a 12-
week pregnant uterus. Laboratory studies are
significant for a hemoglobin level of 85
